    {
      "source": "When comparing two non-null objects, the specified Comparator will be used.\nThe given underlying Comparator must be able to handle the elements that this\nComparator will be applied to.",
      "translation": "比较两个非空对象时，将使用指定的 Comparator。\n给定的底层 Comparator 必须能够处理此 Comparator 将要应用到的元素。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A Comparator that will safely compare nulls to be lower or higher than\nother objects. Can decorate a given Comparator or work on Comparables.",
      "translation": "一个能够安全地将 null 值与其他对象进行比较（使其更低或更高）的 Comparator。它可以装饰给定的 Comparator，也可以直接作用于 Comparable 对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A shared default instance of this comparator, treating nulls higher\nthan non-null objects.",
      "translation": "此比较器的共享默认实例，将 null 视为高于非空对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A shared default instance of this comparator, treating nulls lower\nthan non-null objects.",
      "translation": "此比较器的共享默认实例，将 null 视为低于非空对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in NullSafeComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in NullSafeComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#equals(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">equals</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in NullSafeComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#equals(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">equals</a>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in NullSafeComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>comparator</code> - the comparator to use when comparing two non-null objects",
      "translation": "<code>comparator</code> - 比较两个非空对象时使用的比较器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>nullsLow</code> - whether to treat nulls lower or higher than non-null objects",
      "translation": "<code>nullsLow</code> - 是否将空值视为低于非空对象",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "as of 6.1 in favor of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#nullsLast(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.nullsLast(Comparator)</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#nullsFirst(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.nullsFirst(Comparator)</code></a>",
      "translation": "自 6.1 版本起，推荐使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#nullsLast(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.nullsLast(Comparator)</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#nullsFirst(java.util.Comparator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator.nullsFirst(Comparator)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a NullSafeComparator that sorts <code>null</code> based on the\nprovided flag, decorating the given Comparator.",
      "translation": "创建一个 `NullSafeComparator`，它根据提供的标志对 `<code>null</code>` 进行排序，并装饰给定的 `Comparator`。",
      "count": 1
    },
